Third-party code and assets
===========================

components/bsp/
    FoloToy AI Passport board support package, copied unchanged from
    https://github.com/FoloToy/ai-passport (branch `main`).
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 FoloToy. See LICENSE.

tests/third_party/cJSON/
    cJSON 1.7.18 (https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON), MIT License.
    Used only by the host tests; the firmware uses the cJSON component
    bundled with ESP-IDF.

main/fonts/crt_font_12.c
    Bitmap subset generated by tools/gen_font.py from
    Noto Sans Mono CJK SC Regular (https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk),
    SIL Open Font License 1.1. The source font file is not redistributed.
    See docs/fonts.md for the code point list and regeneration command.

preview/
    Self-contained HTML/CSS/JS; no third-party libraries.
